title: roster
speaker: dm
---
<<challengers>>
<<if $challenger == "">>
    You walk back to the racks. #line:roster_back
<<else>>
    {$hero_name} faces {$challenger_name}! #line:announce
    <<fight {$challenger}>>
    <<if $fight == "won">>
        The crowd chants for you, and {$challenger_name} limps away. #line:bout_won
    <<else>>
        {$challenger_name} raises both arms to the crowd. #line:bout_lost
    <<endif>>
<<endif>>
Reputation {$reputation}. #line:reputation
<<jump roster>>
===
